WEBVTT

00:00.780 --> 00:03.030
Never forget your poker face.

00:03.030 --> 00:04.950
With his father’s teachings in his heart,

00:04.950 --> 00:07.160
the miraculous magician glides through skyscrapers.

00:05.030 --> 00:09.410
Kimi no namida ni kon’na ni koishite’ru
(I love your tears so much)

00:05.030 --> 00:09.410
(Natsu-Iro)

00:07.160 --> 00:09.160
Enter Kaitō Kid!

00:09.160 --> 00:12.160
Today’s target is the Red Tear!

00:12.160 --> 00:15.370
Now, it’s show time!

00:15.370 --> 00:19.800
kimi no namida ni kon’na ni koishite’ru

00:15.370 --> 00:19.800
I love your tears so much

00:19.920 --> 00:22.510
Wow This Summer day Summer night

00:22.670 --> 00:25.680
soba de waratteitai yo

00:22.670 --> 00:25.680
I want to laugh by your side

00:34.310 --> 00:38.020
bōhatei atsui sunahama

00:34.310 --> 00:38.020
On a pier on a warm sandy beach

00:38.310 --> 00:42.780
machiwabita kiseki yatto otozureta

00:38.310 --> 00:42.780
The miracle I longed for finally came true

00:44.780 --> 00:48.530
dōka kono mama stay with me

00:44.780 --> 00:48.530
Please, stay with me, just like this

00:48.910 --> 00:52.410
Everything for you, I’ll always think of you

00:55.000 --> 00:58.710
hoshi furu yoru wa koishikute

00:55.000 --> 00:58.710
I miss the nights with shooting stars

00:59.040 --> 01:03.670
negai komete koe no kagiri utau no

00:59.040 --> 01:03.670
I wish and sing with all of my voice

01:05.260 --> 01:09.350
mō tomerarenai my sweet song

01:05.260 --> 01:09.350
I can’t stop my sweet song anymore

01:09.510 --> 01:14.060
nakisō na koe de I love you

01:09.510 --> 01:14.060
In a tearful voice I cry ‘I love you’

01:14.850 --> 01:19.310
koe ni naranai hodo hito o suki ni nari

01:14.850 --> 01:19.310
When you like someone so much that you can’t verbalise it

01:19.310 --> 01:21.900
Wow This Summer day Summer night

01:21.900 --> 01:24.610
nanimo kamo ga takaramono (baby)

01:21.900 --> 01:24.610
Everything’s a treasure (baby)

01:24.940 --> 01:29.240
kimi no egao ga kon’na ni yūki kureru

01:24.940 --> 01:29.240
Your smile gives me so much courage

01:29.570 --> 01:34.830
hakanaku itoshii kono kimochi dakishimete

01:29.570 --> 01:34.830
as I embrace this fleeting love

01:35.000 --> 01:39.750
kimi no yokogao zutto zutto mitsumete’ta

01:35.000 --> 01:39.750
I’ve always, always been watching you from your side.

01:56.740 --> 01:56.790
The Secret of the Red Tear

02:07.970 --> 02:10.550
Kaitō Kid makes a declaration of war yet again.

02:10.550 --> 02:14.970
He's after the world's biggest ruby, currently in the hands of the group "Hopper's Magic."

02:14.970 --> 02:20.690
Even though he keeps failing, that petty thief hasn't learned his lesson yet.

02:21.850 --> 02:24.440
I've got a reason for not stealing those jewels.

02:24.440 --> 02:27.280
You'd be better off quitting.

02:27.280 --> 02:29.610
Quitting what, Akako-<i>chan</i>?

02:30.730 --> 02:32.570
I'm talking to Kaitō Kid.

02:33.490 --> 02:34.450
Why, you...

02:35.000 --> 02:37.910
There's a rumor about that ruby.

02:37.910 --> 02:43.330
It's the devil's stone. Those who try to get their hands on it will bring misfortune upon themselves.

02:43.330 --> 02:45.490
You mean the Red Tear?

02:46.650 --> 02:47.750
Hakuba-<i>kun</i>…

02:47.750 --> 02:48.620
That's right.

02:49.670 --> 02:53.470
Well, if Kid wants it that badly, then it's inevitable.

02:53.840 --> 02:56.970
Either way, I'm not interested.

02:58.850 --> 03:01.980
Spider's right in the middle of his European tour.

03:01.980 --> 03:04.190
He won't be coming after Kid.

03:04.590 --> 03:06.870
Hey, what's with you?

03:06.870 --> 03:07.780
Nothing much…

03:10.780 --> 03:12.860
There's a girl this beautiful in this class…

03:14.250 --> 03:16.050
Hakuba-<i>kun</i>, your face turned red!

03:16.030 --> 03:17.280
It has not!

03:20.240 --> 03:22.330
The Red Tear…

03:22.330 --> 03:27.210
Wait. That jewel… Long ago, my dad…

03:33.550 --> 03:36.640
Inspector Nakamori! A written notice from Kaitō Kid…

03:36.640 --> 03:39.930
Dear Inspector Nakamori,
my notice for
tomorrow
never happened...
I'm sorry.

03:36.640 --> 03:39.930
Kaitō
Kid

03:37.000 --> 03:39.930
No, a written notice of cancellation…

03:39.930 --> 03:40.970
my notice for
tomorrow
never happened...
I'm sorry.

03:39.930 --> 03:40.600
Kaitō
Kid

03:40.300 --> 03:41.810
What?!

03:44.240 --> 03:46.560
He's quitting?!

03:51.070 --> 03:56.860
The police announced that Kaitō Kid
canceled his heist yesterday evening.

03:56.860 --> 04:00.120
Is Kid going to declare his retirement soon?

04:00.490 --> 04:02.700
Making up stuff on their own…

04:02.700 --> 04:05.960
Kaito! Did you see?!

04:05.960 --> 04:08.750
They've been showing this on the news since this morning!

04:08.750 --> 04:11.380
I'm sure he got scared of my dad.

04:11.380 --> 04:12.670
He's just a coward.

04:12.670 --> 04:16.220
Don't be silly. Who'd be scared of that good-for-nothing Inspector?

04:16.220 --> 04:16.990
Let's go.

04:19.260 --> 04:21.010
Wait up!

04:21.010 --> 04:26.140
Jody Hopper-<i>san</i>, leader of the group in possession of the ruby, "Hopper's Magic,"

04:26.140 --> 04:30.230
commented that "It's a shame I won't be able to see his magic."

04:33.530 --> 04:34.750
And so…

04:37.450 --> 04:40.070
He just pick-pocketed Aoko's wallet!

04:40.070 --> 04:42.080
Hey, wait!! Why, you!

04:45.000 --> 04:47.400
Hey! What happened, Kaito?

04:48.400 --> 04:50.950
Here. Isn't this your wallet?

04:52.090 --> 04:53.490
Huh?

04:53.490 --> 04:56.700
Oh, no, when did I drop it?

04:56.670 --> 04:58.090
A-Amazing!

04:59.010 --> 05:00.890
She got it back so quickly...

05:05.100 --> 05:06.560
Who on earth is she?

05:06.560 --> 05:09.770
I'm so sorry. Thank you very much.

05:09.770 --> 05:10.560
It's all right.

05:11.440 --> 05:15.360
It seems Japanese people really are carefree.

05:16.320 --> 05:17.240
Y-You're…

05:17.740 --> 05:20.030
Aren't you the "Hopper's Magic" Group's…?!

05:20.030 --> 05:23.760
Yes. I'm Jody Hopper, the leader.

05:23.740 --> 05:26.660
So she's a magician… That explains it.

05:26.680 --> 05:30.930
Look, Kaito! Pictures of her have been all over the newspapers and TV since this morning.

05:30.930 --> 05:31.750
I know.

05:32.340 --> 05:35.420
Her grandfather, James Hopper or the "Magician of Fire,"

05:36.370 --> 05:39.400
was one of the greatest magicians.

05:41.160 --> 05:45.930
U-Um, Kaito's dad, Tōichi Kuroba, was also a magician.

05:45.930 --> 05:48.600
Oh, I know him.

05:49.440 --> 05:53.310
Tōichi Kuroba had the world's greatest magical hands.

05:54.730 --> 05:59.400
But in the end, neither he nor my grandfather were any different from that pickpocket.

06:01.090 --> 06:05.700
They were just cunning frauds who fool people's eyes and rob their money.

06:06.990 --> 06:11.370
Well, those who've been fooled are also at fault.

06:11.370 --> 06:14.960
B-But, aren't you a magician too?

06:14.960 --> 06:21.510
I've merely reluctantly succeeded my grandfather who passed away two years ago.

06:21.510 --> 06:24.010
But tonight I'm done with that.

06:24.850 --> 06:26.150
Done?

06:26.150 --> 06:27.310
That's right.

06:27.310 --> 06:30.440
Tonight is the "Hopper's Magic" group's last show.

06:30.440 --> 06:32.100
You two are welcome to come if you want.

06:35.190 --> 06:36.070
Are you sure?

06:38.330 --> 06:40.940
That is if you want to be deceived by us frauds.

06:49.120 --> 06:51.000
It's those guys from the organisation!

06:51.460 --> 06:53.630
So they're after the Red Tear after all…

06:54.750 --> 06:56.960
But that's…

06:56.960 --> 07:01.600
Oh, no! Kaito, we're going to miss the movie!

07:02.450 --> 07:04.260
Say, what should we do?

07:04.260 --> 07:07.260
These are tickets to the dinner show in the Minato Hotel.

07:07.260 --> 07:08.350
We're going, right?

07:09.390 --> 07:11.180
Who would go?

07:11.180 --> 07:14.310
I refuse to watch a show by someone who's mocking magicians!

07:15.410 --> 07:18.440
There you go again Kaito, being all stubborn!

07:18.440 --> 07:20.190
I'm not being stubborn!

07:20.190 --> 07:22.430
Look, if we don't hurry up, the movie's going to start.

07:28.790 --> 07:32.460
There's even a restaurant on the rooftop.

07:32.460 --> 07:36.550
And so, the dinner show is on the 5th floor.

07:36.540 --> 07:39.250
Don't be unreasonable, young master.

07:39.670 --> 07:41.130
I know!

07:43.400 --> 07:44.750
Who's being unreasonable?!

07:51.060 --> 07:57.360
Right about now I'm sure Inspector Nakamori,
persistent as he is, has some detectives keeping watch.

07:57.360 --> 08:03.280
And then the guys from the organisation are all set and having dinner.

08:10.330 --> 08:14.660
Is Kaitō Kid really not coming?

08:14.660 --> 08:17.330
That sly, snobbish villain.

08:18.540 --> 08:21.760
Kaito should've come.

08:21.760 --> 08:23.130
He's so stubborn.

08:25.160 --> 08:27.090
Everything's according to plan.

08:28.010 --> 08:30.510
I'm executing the plan at the scheduled time.

08:35.690 --> 08:39.290
Geez. What's with you, dad?

08:39.270 --> 08:40.730
What's with the grim face?

08:41.360 --> 08:44.740
Kid's not coming, so why don't you enjoy yourself?

08:46.750 --> 08:49.530
I guess you're right. Well done, well done.

08:51.280 --> 08:52.190
Geez!

08:53.160 --> 08:57.540
And then I'm sure Aoko's in a bad mood.

09:00.320 --> 09:02.390
I'm leaving it to you, Jii-<i>chan</i>.

09:02.390 --> 09:03.340
Take care.

09:08.650 --> 09:10.300
If you'll excuse me…

09:10.300 --> 09:11.260
It's no good…

09:11.260 --> 09:13.270
Like this… Let's see…

09:13.270 --> 09:15.310
Like this… Like…

09:16.320 --> 09:18.520
Like this… Like…

09:18.520 --> 09:20.310
Move faster!

09:23.730 --> 09:25.140
More swiftly!

09:25.140 --> 09:26.700
Like this!

09:28.910 --> 09:29.660
Who are you?

09:30.520 --> 09:31.070
Sorry.

09:31.070 --> 09:34.040
You've been eagerly practicing for quite a bit, so...

09:34.580 --> 09:38.670
This is my last chance to get recognised by the leader.

09:39.890 --> 09:44.550
I want to change her mind and make this magic group go on.

09:44.550 --> 09:46.550
And I want to make her perform magic again.

09:48.550 --> 09:49.740
I beg of you!

09:49.740 --> 09:52.510
Please let me see you do that again!

09:54.770 --> 09:59.060
In exchange, I've got a little favour I'd like to ask of you.

10:01.420 --> 10:02.940
Look, Dad!

10:03.480 --> 10:05.700
The person greeting people over there

10:05.700 --> 10:07.940
is Jody-<i>san</i>, the leader.

10:10.360 --> 10:15.080
Then what she has attached to her chest is the world's biggest ruby.

10:15.650 --> 10:18.250
Even though it's a ruby, it's shining blue.

10:19.290 --> 10:20.330
It's pretty...

10:22.910 --> 10:25.490
Hey you, are you a member of the magic group?

10:25.490 --> 10:27.510
Y-Yes.

10:27.510 --> 10:30.000
Is she always wearing that jewel?

10:30.000 --> 10:30.580
Yes.

10:31.700 --> 10:35.260
That's kind of like our magic group's trademark.

10:36.390 --> 10:39.850
It was inherited from Master James, our original leader.

10:39.840 --> 10:45.010
During the show it must be worn by the leader.

10:45.550 --> 10:50.110
U-Um, Jody-<i>san</i>'s part isn't in the program.

10:50.110 --> 10:56.850
That's because ever since she lost her parents in an accident 10 years ago…

10:56.850 --> 10:57.910
Accident?

10:57.910 --> 10:58.860
Yes.

10:59.850 --> 11:01.790
It was in the middle of a show.

11:01.790 --> 11:06.550
And that happened to be the big day

11:06.550 --> 11:11.260
when her parents inherited the jewel as the new leaders…

11:13.890 --> 11:16.930
That "Devil's Stone" that Akako-<i>chan</i> mentioned…

11:16.930 --> 11:18.520
I'm sure it was named that after that incident.

11:19.350 --> 11:23.480
She hasn't performed any magic since then.

11:23.960 --> 11:30.440
She probably loathes the magic that took her parents' lives.

11:30.440 --> 11:36.550
Master James grieved that until the day he died.

11:36.550 --> 11:38.870
Jody-<i>san</i>… That's why…

11:52.540 --> 11:56.850
Oh? It seems there's one more.

11:58.310 --> 12:00.140
Way to go, Paul!

12:01.180 --> 12:04.600
But was Paul ever this good?

12:07.010 --> 12:10.730
Now, we've come at last to the finale of the show!

12:11.320 --> 12:13.440
And the magic to decorate our last show is...?!

12:22.080 --> 12:25.570
Why don't you leave the finale to me?!

12:28.140 --> 12:29.340
Kaitō Kid!!

12:35.070 --> 12:37.600
Don't let him get away! After him!!

12:54.930 --> 12:56.540
Kaitō Kid…

12:56.540 --> 12:57.390
Leader!

12:59.350 --> 13:00.310
Are you all right?!

13:00.310 --> 13:02.300
Paul… Yes.

13:13.410 --> 13:16.320
Milady, run!

13:16.710 --> 13:20.870
Rest assured. We haven't killed anyone yet.

13:22.250 --> 13:24.340
I'm going to count to three.

13:24.340 --> 13:28.550
If you don't want to get hurt then give me that jewel.

13:28.550 --> 13:29.800
You mustn't!

13:29.800 --> 13:32.240
Milady, that jewel is…

13:32.240 --> 13:33.760
1…

13:33.760 --> 13:34.670
Robert!

13:34.670 --> 13:35.890
2…

13:37.450 --> 13:38.140
3!

13:41.360 --> 13:42.020
Paul!

13:43.930 --> 13:45.350
What a moron!

13:53.110 --> 13:55.190
Wait! Kid!!

14:01.870 --> 14:04.740
K-Kid fired a shot?!

14:18.680 --> 14:23.260
Now, Milady, haven't you had enough already? Hand it over.

14:23.680 --> 14:24.470
You can have it!

14:25.560 --> 14:27.810
This cursed jewel!

14:28.770 --> 14:29.650
What?!

14:30.120 --> 14:34.610
We can't hand that to them, Milady.

14:35.180 --> 14:37.940
Paul?! Y-You…

14:37.940 --> 14:42.150
Yes. I'm all right. I'm wearing a bulletproof vest.

14:43.160 --> 14:44.310
Why would you be wearing such a thing?!

14:46.500 --> 14:48.500
That's because I'm…

14:50.460 --> 14:52.590
Kaitō Kid.

14:52.590 --> 14:54.250
Y-You!

14:54.760 --> 14:56.440
But Kid was just…

14:56.440 --> 15:02.470
That was probably a decoy that they set up in order to drive the police out of here.

15:04.260 --> 15:07.020
But didn't you come to steal that jewel too?!

15:07.020 --> 15:10.120
I didn't come to steal it.

15:10.120 --> 15:13.420
I came to protect it, along with you.

15:21.790 --> 15:22.700
Find them!

15:22.700 --> 15:23.360
Yes, sir!

15:29.880 --> 15:32.040
Where's Paul?

15:32.040 --> 15:35.370
He's hiding momentarily.

15:35.370 --> 15:36.840
You'll be able to see him very soon.

15:37.960 --> 15:40.130
So it was you on the show.

15:42.070 --> 15:45.210
I knew that was too good to be Paul.

15:45.210 --> 15:46.640
No.

15:46.640 --> 15:50.480
I disguised as Paul after his part.

15:50.480 --> 15:52.680
That was his magic.

15:52.680 --> 15:55.150
And it was for you to see.

16:00.520 --> 16:01.070
Come!

16:04.320 --> 16:05.530
They caught up with us?!

16:09.370 --> 16:10.820
All right!

16:10.820 --> 16:11.660
Give it to me!

16:15.790 --> 16:17.210
What?!

16:20.920 --> 16:23.680
That's James Hopper's granddaughter, all right!

16:27.620 --> 16:29.020
That serves you right!

16:30.470 --> 16:31.350
Well done.

16:32.600 --> 16:35.560
Even though you're supposed to have stopped performing magic already.

16:37.350 --> 16:42.070
I owe it to the training I did with my parents and grandparents from when I was little.

16:43.460 --> 16:45.460
W-Who… are you?

16:46.440 --> 16:48.450
Why do you know…

16:48.450 --> 16:49.830
I'm just...

16:54.370 --> 16:56.080
…a petty thief who never learns his lesson.

16:56.080 --> 16:59.300
Now you've done it, little girl!!

17:03.170 --> 17:04.250
But why?

17:05.070 --> 17:08.600
Why do you have to protect me and this jewel?

17:09.180 --> 17:10.350
Answer me, Kid!

17:11.520 --> 17:13.940
Revolving Restaurant

17:11.520 --> 17:13.940
Elevator

17:11.520 --> 17:12.960
Hey, What're you doing?!

17:13.940 --> 17:18.650
Revolving Restaurant

17:13.940 --> 17:18.650
Elevator

17:15.620 --> 17:17.390
Everyone, please calm down and take shelter!

17:21.910 --> 17:22.990
Up there!

17:23.510 --> 17:25.910
He's still airborne!

17:26.950 --> 17:28.320
Where's Boss Snake?!

17:28.910 --> 17:30.490
I haven't received an order for a while!

17:33.350 --> 17:37.420
Step aside… I don't have time to play games with you!

17:37.800 --> 17:40.470
Give me the jewel!

17:40.470 --> 17:42.350
Thanks for the trouble!

17:42.350 --> 17:47.010
But her jewel doesn't have the Pandora you're looking for.

17:47.390 --> 17:50.390
It has something far more valuable than that!

17:52.090 --> 17:54.480
But you guys probably wouldn't understand that!

17:55.700 --> 17:57.000
Shut up.

17:57.000 --> 17:59.670
We're going to be the ones to confirm whether it has Pandora or not!

18:01.370 --> 18:01.910
What's this?!

18:03.400 --> 18:06.820
I tampered a little with the revolving contraption here.

18:20.880 --> 18:22.590
Tell this to your boss!

18:22.590 --> 18:26.880
I, Kaitō Kid, swear to crush your organisation!

18:29.200 --> 18:32.040
What are you trying to do with a toy like that?

18:43.320 --> 18:45.240
Just in time to meet your partner!

18:55.020 --> 18:58.500
K-Kid fell! Go!!

19:06.720 --> 19:09.380
Jii-<i>chan</i> overshot the mark as I thought!

19:09.380 --> 19:11.090
Thank you, Kid.

19:11.540 --> 19:12.700
You saved me.

19:13.660 --> 19:17.440
But I guess this is the devil's stone after all.

19:17.440 --> 19:20.910
Because of this jewel, group members got hurt,

19:20.910 --> 19:26.730
the show was ruined, and it turned out to be a cursed last show.

19:26.730 --> 19:30.530
Don't you think there is something strange with that ruby?

19:30.530 --> 19:35.080
Even though rubies are usually red, that jewel is blue.

19:35.080 --> 19:39.370
Furthermore, it's called the Red Tear.

19:39.370 --> 19:42.750
Red… the red of fire...

19:42.740 --> 19:43.440
That's right.

19:46.950 --> 19:47.860
Take a look.

19:51.640 --> 19:57.980
This is the last magic that your grandfather, James Hopper, the "Magician of Fire," left in this world.

20:04.400 --> 20:07.860
Grandfather... Dad... Mum!

20:09.100 --> 20:11.040
"Dear Jody…

20:11.040 --> 20:19.580
"Remember once more your heartbeat from the time you first stood on the stage.

20:19.580 --> 20:28.130
"When this jewel shines red, I wish for Jody Hopper, the child of magic, to be revitalised…"

20:30.970 --> 20:32.340
Grandfather…

20:35.260 --> 20:36.140
Dad…

20:38.730 --> 20:41.070
That person is amazing!

20:41.070 --> 20:45.270
Setting up a trick like that by using the jewel's angle of reflection!

20:46.590 --> 20:49.270
It's called the Red Tear.

20:49.270 --> 20:54.200
It's special magic he put into the jewel for his grandchild.

20:55.320 --> 20:59.290
I managed to protect it, Dad.

20:59.290 --> 21:04.370
I had forgotten that I looked like that while performing magic.

21:05.330 --> 21:10.570
My parents and grandparents were really strict with me during my magic practice.

21:10.570 --> 21:13.840
But they always watched over me so tenderly.

21:18.960 --> 21:21.000
And even now…

21:24.750 --> 21:26.060
Leader!!

21:26.610 --> 21:28.650
I'm so glad you're safe.

21:28.650 --> 21:29.520
Paul...

21:32.400 --> 21:35.910
Can you still keep this magic group going?

21:35.910 --> 21:38.370
Of course!

21:38.940 --> 21:41.120
Come and follow me without falling down.

21:41.120 --> 21:44.290
From now on, I too will be standing on the same stage.

21:44.680 --> 21:46.340
Leader…

21:46.340 --> 21:46.940
Yes!

21:49.010 --> 21:49.640
Kid…

21:53.840 --> 21:56.640
Kid… I promise you.

21:56.640 --> 21:59.100
I'll never forget it again.

22:01.470 --> 22:02.140
This is…

22:06.190 --> 22:11.230
Where'd you disappear to, Kid?!

22:17.560 --> 22:18.950
Kaito!

22:21.330 --> 22:25.160
So you did come to see it after all.

22:26.430 --> 22:28.790
I could run this show by myself!

22:28.790 --> 22:31.940
Then let me see you do it right now, right here!

22:31.940 --> 22:34.250
Don't be silly. Who'd do such a thing?

22:37.550 --> 22:43.720
After seeing the Red Tear, no matter what I were to do, I'd still be upstaged.

22:46.230 --> 22:47.270
Shin’ichi Kudō

22:47.140 --> 22:50.650
Koi ni Koishite
(Falling in love)

22:47.140 --> 22:50.650
(Mai Kuraki)

22:51.610 --> 22:56.320
kimi ni zenzen kyōmi nai uso you are my perfect guy

22:51.610 --> 22:56.320
I’m not interested in you at all — I’m lying, you are my perfect guy

22:56.820 --> 23:01.320
tokimeki wa kakusenai honto wa ki ni natte shikatanai

22:56.820 --> 23:01.320
I can’t hide my beating heart, I’m really into you, I can’t help it

23:01.830 --> 23:06.330
koi ni bukiyō son’na style kimi no mae da to betsujin mitai

23:01.830 --> 23:06.330
I’m no good at love, with a bad style, I become someone else when facing you

23:06.910 --> 23:10.790
dare ni mo ienai himitsu no mama

23:06.910 --> 23:10.790
I don’t tell anyone about it

23:11.920 --> 23:15.880
soredemo I’m alright koi no yukue nante

23:11.920 --> 23:15.880
Still, I’m alright, love just isn’t for me

23:16.210 --> 23:20.180
mada it isn’t the last chance for me

23:16.210 --> 23:20.180
and it still isn’t the last chance for me

23:20.800 --> 23:25.770
iron’na love story o egaite’ru mune no naka

23:20.800 --> 23:25.770
I have many love stories carved into my heart

23:25.930 --> 23:31.060
demo risō ni wa hodo to’oi

23:25.930 --> 23:31.060
but they’re far from my ideals

23:31.560 --> 23:36.480
watashi-tte wagamama sore kurai no koto wakatte’ru

23:31.560 --> 23:36.480
I know I’m selfish but...

23:36.650 --> 23:42.660
dakedo nani ka ikenai no?

23:36.650 --> 23:42.660
...is there anything wrong with that?

23:43.330 --> 23:44.740
Edogawa

23:43.330 --> 23:52.960
kimi to no koi ni koi o shite’ru dake de tsutaetakute mo mada

23:43.330 --> 23:52.960
Just being in love with you is enough, I couldn’t confess even if I wanted to...

23:53.290 --> 24:06.320
himitsu ni shite’ru hō ga shiawase dakara ima wa watashi dake no secret love

23:53.290 --> 24:06.320
I’m happier with it being a secret, so for now, it’ll be my secret love

24:00.090 --> 24:06.710
To Conan
Edogawa-<i>kun</i>
